WEBVTT

00:05:59.522 --> 00:06:01.649
Instead, how about ...

00:06:01.649 --> 00:06:03.609
NB: When you've been up all night --

00:06:03.609 --> 00:06:04.985
"Yours heavily caffeinated."

00:06:05.027 --> 00:06:06.445
(Laughter)

00:06:06.487 --> 00:06:08.948
JA: When you're talking
about financial accounting?

00:06:08.989 --> 00:06:11.200
"Let's never speak of this again."

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:13.828
NB: And on rare occasion, "I'm the best."

00:06:13.869 --> 00:06:15.121
(Laughter)

00:06:15.162 --> 00:06:17.790
Sometimes, you've just
got to let people know.

00:06:17.832 --> 00:06:19.583
Now, it's easy to believe

00:06:19.625 --> 00:06:23.003
that if we take our lives
or our mission seriously,

00:06:23.045 --> 00:06:25.339
the presence of humor
betrays that mission.

00:06:25.381 --> 00:06:28.259
That gravity and levity
are somehow at odds.

00:06:28.300 --> 00:06:30.428
But our research tells a different story.